   "key": 48,
   "len": 78,
   "first": 867,
   "line": "Together they are forty-one stories tall.",
   "note": "ch1"
  },
  {
   "id": "S13",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 53,
   "len": 85,
   "first": 945,
   "line": "You will be on board for twenty-two and a half hours.",
   "note": "ch1"
  },
  {
   "id": "S14",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 50,
   "len": 81,
   "first": 1030,
   "line": "The catch at the end has never been tried on a ship.",
   "note": "ch1"
  },
  {
   "id": "S15",
   "size": "panr",
   "key": 69,
   "len": 111,
   "first": 1111,
   "line": "Buckle up. Friday, thirteenth of November.",
   "note": "ch1"
  },
  {
   "id": "S16",
   "size": "pan",
   "key": 54,
   "len": 87,
   "first": 1222,
   "line": "Four forty-seven in the afternoon, Texas time.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S17",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 52,
   "len": 84,
   "first": 1309,
   "line": "Twelve million pounds of fuel sit under your feet.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S18",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 44,
   "len": 71,
   "first": 1393,
   "line": "Liquid oxygen. Liquid methane.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S19",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 45,
   "len": 72,
   "first": 1464,
   "line": "Thirty-three engines wake up beneath you.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S20",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 24,
   "len": 38,
   "first": 1536,
   "line": "And you rise.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S21",
   "size": "tilt",
   "key": 48,
   "len": 78,
   "first": 1574,
   "line": "A forty-one-story megarocket, climbing.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S22",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 53,
   "len": 86,
   "first": 1652,
   "line": "Faster. Higher. The sky goes dark.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S23",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 42,
   "len": 67,
   "first": 1738,
   "line": "Minutes in, the stack comes apart.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S24",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 47,
   "len": 76,
   "first": 1805,
   "line": "One of the booster's engines may have dropped out.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S25",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 77,
   "len": 124,
   "first": 1881,
   "line": "You keep climbing. Six engines. All good.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S26",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 41,
   "len": 66,
   "first": 2005,
   "line": "Below you, the booster turns for home.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S27",
   "size": "pan",
   "key": 46,
   "len": 75,
   "first": 2071,
   "line": "It plans to land in the same arms you will.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S28",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 59,
   "len": 95,
   "first": 2146,
   "line": "SpaceX has caught a booster three times before.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S29",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 33,
   "len": 54,
   "first": 2241,
   "line": "This time, an alarm goes off.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S30",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 58,
   "len": 93,
   "first": 2295,
   "line": "Low fuel mass. The burn ended early.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S31",
   "size": "tilt",
   "key": 40,
   "len": 64,
   "first": 2388,
   "line": "The booster checks its own position.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S32",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 32,
   "len": 51,
   "first": 2452,
   "line": "It is not where it should be.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S33",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 56,
   "len": 90,
   "first": 2503,
   "line": "So it aborts itself. Out over the Gulf.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S34",
   "size": "pullout",
   "key": 49,
   "len": 79,
   "first": 2593,
   "line": "One half of the dream goes into the water.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S35",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 45,
   "len": 73,
   "first": 2672,
   "line": "Now it is all on you.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S36",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 66,
   "len": 107,
   "first": 2745,
   "line": "Twenty-six minutes after liftoff, one engine relights.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S37",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 25,
   "len": 41,
   "first": 2852,
   "line": "For twenty seconds.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S38",
   "size": "pullout",
   "key": 55,
   "len": 89,
   "first": 2893,
   "line": "And the engine goes quiet. You are in orbit.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S39",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 54,
   "len": 87,
   "first": 2982,
   "line": "Only the second time Starship has ever done this.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S40",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 46,
   "len": 75,
   "first": 3069,
   "line": "Two hundred seventy-five kilometres up.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S41",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 42,
   "len": 68,
   "first": 3144,
   "line": "You are carrying twenty-six passengers.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S42",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 59,
   "len": 95,
   "first": 3212,
   "line": "Starlink satellites, stacked like a pez dispenser.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S43",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 30,
   "len": 48,
   "first": 3307,
   "line": "Pop. Pop. Pop.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S44",
   "size": "pan",
   "key": 36,
   "len": 58,
   "first": 3355,
   "line": "Twelve gone in the first hour.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S45",
   "size": "tilt",
   "key": 40,
   "len": 65,
   "first": 3413,
   "line": "One of them turns its camera back at you.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S46",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 57,
   "len": 92,
   "first": 3478,
   "line": "It is checking your heat shield, tile by tile.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S47",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 43,
   "len": 70,
   "first": 3570,
   "line": "One tile was installed by MrBeast.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S48",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 25,
   "len": 41,
   "first": 3640,
   "line": "No pressure, tile.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S49",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 56,
   "len": 90,
   "first": 3681,
   "line": "At the one hour seventeen mark, the last one leaves.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S50",
   "size": "pullout",
   "key": 73,
   "len": 118,
   "first": 3771,
   "line": "But your day is not over. You still have to get down.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S51",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 40,
   "len": 65,
   "first": 3889,
   "line": "Now you coast. And coast.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S52",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 42,
   "len": 67,
   "first": 3954,
   "line": "Twenty-six thousand kilometres an hour.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S53",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 51,
   "len": 83,
   "first": 4021,
   "line": "About ninety-six minutes to circle the planet.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S54",
   "size": "pan",
   "key": 87,
   "len": 140,
   "first": 4104,
   "line": "Lap three. Lap four. Southeast Asia, then the Indian Ocean.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S55",
   "size": "tilt",
   "key": 46,
   "len": 75,
   "first": 4244,
   "line": "You see a sunrise on every single lap.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S56",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 60,
   "len": 96,
   "first": 4319,
   "line": "Seven hours in, mission control gets a choice.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S57",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 54,
   "len": 87,
   "first": 4415,
   "line": "Bring you down early, in the ocean off Chile?",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S58",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 25,
   "len": 40,
   "first": 4502,
   "line": "Or let you stay?",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S59",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 43,
   "len": 69,
   "first": 4542,
   "line": "Go. You stay in space.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S60",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 69,
   "len": 111,
   "first": 4611,
   "line": "Lap ten. Lap eleven. Longest Starship flight ever.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S61",
   "size": "pan",
   "key": 74,
   "len": 119,
   "first": 4722,
   "line": "Heat shield data comes back clean. The heat shield is fine.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S62",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 52,
   "len": 84,
   "first": 4841,
   "line": "Hour twenty. The last go or no-go.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S63",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 68,
   "len": 109,
   "first": 4925,
   "line": "Every team polls go. Even the tower.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S64",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 66,
   "len": 106,
   "first": 5034,
   "line": "Three twenty-three in the afternoon. The deorbit burn.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S65",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 43,
   "len": 69,
   "first": 5140,
   "line": "Ten seconds. One engine.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S66",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 48,
   "len": 77,
   "first": 5209,
   "line": "That is all it takes to fall out of the sky.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S67",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 31,
   "len": 50,
   "first": 5286,
   "line": "The air starts to bite.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S68",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 33,
   "len": 53,
   "first": 5336,
   "line": "Your leading edges glow.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S69",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 52,
   "len": 84,
   "first": 5389,
   "line": "Orange. Then pink. Then white.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S70",
   "size": "pullout",
   "key": 55,
   "len": 89,
   "first": 5473,
   "line": "Heat-shield tiles stand between you and the fire.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S71",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 43,
   "len": 70,
   "first": 5562,
   "line": "You cannot see out. You cannot steer.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S72",
   "size": "pan",
   "key": 68,
   "len": 109,
   "first": 5632,
   "line": "The ship does it for you. Flaps, flipping, falling.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S73",
   "size": "tilt",
   "key": 26,
   "len": 42,
   "first": 5741,
   "line": "Then the plasma fades.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S74",
   "size": "panr",
   "key": 54,
   "len": 87,
   "first": 5783,
   "line": "Texas is below you. And so is the tower.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S75",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 55,
   "len": 88,
   "first": 5870,
   "line": "Now the hard part. You have to land on your tail.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S76",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 59,
   "len": 95,
   "first": 5958,
   "line": "The engines relight. The ship flips upright.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S77",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 64,
   "len": 104,
   "first": 6053,
   "line": "Dust rolls out from the pad like a storm.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S78",
   "size": "pullout",
   "key": 32,
   "len": 51,
   "first": 6157,
   "line": "The arms open wide.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S79",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 46,
   "len": 75,
   "first": 6208,
   "line": "You are falling toward two steel rails.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S80",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 46,
   "len": 74,
   "first": 6283,
   "line": "The engine slows you almost to a stop.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S81",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 46,
   "len": 75,
   "first": 6357,
   "line": "A hover. Right between the arms.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S82",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 25,
   "len": 41,
   "first": 6432,
   "line": "The arms close.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S83",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 22,
   "len": 36,
   "first": 6473,
   "line": "Engines off.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S84",
   "size": "pullout",
   "key": 52,
   "len": 84,
   "first": 6509,
   "line": "Four-twenty in the afternoon, eastern time.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S85",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 46,
   "len": 75,
   "first": 6593,
   "line": "Twenty-two and a half hours after you left.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S86",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 46,
   "len": 75,
   "first": 6668,
   "line": "You flew around Earth fourteen times.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S87",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 48,
   "len": 78,
   "first": 6743,
   "line": "And you are standing exactly where you started.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S88",
   "size": "pan",
   "key": 61,
   "len": 98,
   "first": 6821,
   "line": "The commentator called it the holy grail of spaceflight.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S89",
   "size": "tilt",
   "key": 68,
   "len": 110,
   "first": 6919,
   "line": "Plummeting through fire, snatched out of the air by steel.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S90",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 105,
   "len": 169,
   "first": 7029,
   "line": "The booster was caught three times. The ship, never. Until today.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S91",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 48,
   "len": 78,
   "first": 7198,
   "line": "The ship flies higher and comes in faster.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S92",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 41,
   "len": 66,
   "first": 7276,
   "line": "That is why it was the tougher target.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S93",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 55,
   "len": 89,
   "first": 7342,
   "line": "A rocket you can catch is a rocket you can reuse.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S94",
   "size": "pullout",
   "key": 43,
   "len": 70,
   "first": 7431,
   "line": "And reuse makes spaceflight cheaper.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S95",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 58,
   "len": 93,
   "first": 7501,
   "line": "NASA is counting on it for its Artemis astronauts.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S96",
   "size": "pan",
   "key": 56,
   "len": 91,
   "first": 7594,
   "line": "Starship will practise docking with Orion next year.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S97",
   "size": "tilt",
   "key": 43,
   "len": 69,
   "first": 7685,
   "line": "So the next time you look up, remember.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S98",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 63,
   "len": 102,
   "first": 7754,
   "line": "Something huge can fall from the sky and be caught like a cup.",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S99",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 76,
   "len": 123,
   "first": 7856,
   "line": "Which part scared you most: the launch, the plasma, or the catch?",
   "note": "ch8"
  },
  {
   "id": "S100",
   "size": "pullout",
   "key": 84,
   "len": 135,
   "first": 7979,
   "line": "Tomorrow: another what if, another piece of the sky.",
   "note": "ch8"
  }
 ],
 "fx": [],
